                        <description><![CDATA[<p>The <code>paige/icon</code> shortcode displays a web font icon.</p><h2 id=class-parameter>Class parameter</h2><p>Code:</p><div class=highlight><pre tabindex=0 style=background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4><code class=language-go-html-template data-lang=go-html-template><span style=display:flex><span><span style=color:#1f2328>&lt;</span><span style=color:#0550ae>p</span> <span style=color:#1f2328>class</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;display-1&#34;</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&gt;</span>Icon: <span style=color:#57606a>{{</span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>&lt;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>paige</span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>/</span><span style=color:#1f2328>icon</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>class</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;bi bi-github&#34;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>&gt;</span><span style=color:#57606a>}}</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&lt;/</span><span style=color:#0550ae>p</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&gt;</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Result:</p><p class=display-1>Icon:
<span class=paige-shortcode-icon><i class="bi bi-github"></i></span></p><h2 id=title-parameter>Title parameter</h2><p>Code:</p><div class=highlight><pre tabindex=0 style=background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4><code class=language-go-html-template data-lang=go-html-template><span style=display:flex><span><span style=color:#1f2328>&lt;</span><span style=color:#0550ae>p</span> <span style=color:#1f2328>class</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;display-1&#34;</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&gt;</span>Icon: <span style=color:#57606a>{{</span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>&lt;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>paige</span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>/</span><span style=color:#1f2328>icon</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>class</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;bi bi-github&#34;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>title</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;GitHub&#34;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>&gt;</span><span style=color:#57606a>}}</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&lt;/</span><span style=color:#0550ae>p</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&gt;</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Result:</p><p class=display-1>Icon:
<span class=paige-shortcode-icon><i class="bi bi-github" title=GitHub><span class=visually-hidden>GitHub</span></i></span></p><h2 id=url-parameter>Url parameter</h2><p>Code:</p><div class=highlight><pre tabindex=0 style=background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4><code class=language-go-html-template data-lang=go-html-template><span style=display:flex><span><span style=color:#1f2328>&lt;</span><span style=color:#0550ae>p</span> <span style=color:#1f2328>class</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;display-1&#34;</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&gt;</span>Icon: <span style=color:#57606a>{{</span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>&lt;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>paige</span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>/</span><span style=color:#1f2328>icon</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>class</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;bi bi-github&#34;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#1f2328>url</span><span style=color:#0550ae>=</span><span style=color:#0a3069>&#34;https://github.com/willfaught/paige&#34;</span><span style=color:#fff> </span><span style=color:#f6f8fa;background-color:#82071e>&gt;</span><span style=color:#57606a>}}</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&lt;/</span><span style=color:#0550ae>p</span><span style=color:#1f2328>&gt;</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Result:</p><p class=display-1>Icon:
<span class=paige-shortcode-icon><a href=https://github.com/willfaught/paige><i class="bi bi-github"></i></a></span></p>]]></description>
                    

                    
